    "text": "[2026-10-26T10:54:00Z] Elena: That makes sense—thanks for the reassurance! I’ll definitely focus on showcasing a real-world microservice project with clear performance metrics. And Sarah sounds busy but happy; I’ll have to catch up with her soon. One more thing—any suggestions on balancing learning Rust syntax with writing effective unit tests for these WASM modules? It feels like I’m juggling a lot at once! 😅",
