    "text": "[2026-11-16T11:52:00Z] Elena: Thanks so much for the tips on tooling and debugging! I'll definitely give `wasm-pack` a try. Setting up those focus blocks sounds like a game-changer for keeping family time sacred. Do you have any suggestions for quick wins to build confidence early on, like specific projects or challenges that feel rewarding but aren't too daunting?",
